# navfeeder-esp test build for the mosaic-G5 P3 observer alone: the 162mm card with the
# 162mm LED panel, MCP79412 RTC and INA3221 rail monitor; the mosaic-G5 is configured and
# read in SBF (docs/SBF-RECEIVER.md). It still runs only what the manifest lists. Loaded after sdkconfig.defaults and sdkconfig.defaults.s3; see
# build-navfeeder-esp.sh.
CONFIG_NVF_BOARD_GNSS_COLOR_MOSAIC_P3=y
